  "metaTitle": "No-Minimum Custom Electronics | Perfect Imprints",
  "metaDescription": "Order no-minimum custom electronics with low MOQs. Perfect for small teams and events. Get branded power banks, speakers, and more at Perfect Imprints.",
  "introHtml": "<p>No-minimum custom electronics let you order branded tech gear in small quantities—ideal for small businesses, startups, or one-off events. Unlike typical bulk orders, there is no minimum order requirement, so you can buy as few as a single unit. This flexibility makes it easy to test products, outfit a small team, or create memorable giveaways without overcommitting. From power banks to Bluetooth speakers, you get the same quality and customization options as large orders, but with lower upfront costs and less inventory risk.</p>",
